            "Expression": "if (!$prop('DcsExtraTelemetryPlugin.DCSExtra.Connected') || !$prop('DcsExtraTelemetryPlugin.DCSExtra.Haptic.EngineVersion')) return 0;\nif (!$prop('DcsExtraTelemetryPlugin.DCSExtra.Connected')) return 0;\nvar target = 0;\r\nif ($prop('DcsExtraTelemetryPlugin.DCSExtra.Connected') && $prop('DcsExtraTelemetryPlugin.DCSExtra.Has.AirData') && !$prop('DcsExtraTelemetryPlugin.DCSExtra.OnGround')) {\r\nvar ias = $prop('DcsExtraTelemetryPlugin.DCSExtra.IndicatedAirSpeedMps');\r\n// Begin near maximum cruise and build toward the module's declared maximum\r\n// speed. This remains a restrained airframe texture, not a VNE warning.\r\nvar onset = 75;\r\nvar full = 95;\r\nvar cue = (ias - onset) / (full - onset);\r\ncue = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, cue));\r\ntarget = 28 * cue * cue;\r\n}\r\nvar coefficient = target > root[\"cruiseBuffetLevel\"] ? 0.09 : 0.035;\r\nroot[\"cruiseBuffetLevel\"] = root[\"cruiseBuffetLevel\"] +\r\n    (target - root[\"cruiseBuffetLevel\"]) * coefficient;\r\nif (target === 0 && root[\"cruiseBuffetLevel\"] < 0.05) root[\"cruiseBuffetLevel\"] = 0;\r\nreturn Math.max(0, Math.min(28, root[\"cruiseBuffetLevel\"]));",
            "PreExpression": "root[\"cruiseBuffetLevel\"] = 0;"
